culturally diverse protagonists.\n\nUpon its release, *[Harper's Magazine](/wiki/Harper%27s_Magazine \"Harper's 
Magazine\")* called the book \"almost certainly the finest work ever written about an American [preparatory 
school](/wiki/College-preparatory_school \"College-preparatory school\")\". It is often considered Auchincloss' greatest
