### 4. Good Reading Copy – Literary Blog Review

- **Title:** The Rector of Justin by Louis Auchincloss  
- **URL:** https://goodreadingcopy.wordpress.com/2013/09/02/the-rector-of-justin-by-louis-auchincloss  
- **Author:** Blog author (name not obvious; likely site owner)  
